thon","description":"a set utilities that ake advantage of python's `multiprocessing` module to distribute CPU-intensive tasks","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":97035,"python_rank":16271},{"name":"saransh2405/bi-gram-word-suggestion","owner":"saransh2405","html_url":"https://github.com/saransh2405/bi-gram-word-suggestion","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"In the fields of computational linguistics and probability, an n-gram is a contiguous sequence of n items from a given sequence of text or speech. The items can be phonemes, syllables, letters, words or base pairs according to the application. The n-grams typically are collected from a text or speech corpus. When the items are words, n-grams may also be called shingles.[1]  An n-gram of size 1 is referred to as a \"unigram\"; size 2 is a \"bigram\" (or, less commonly, a \"digram\"); size 3 is a \"trigram\". Larger sizes are sometimes referred to by the value of n, e.g., \"four-gram\", \"five-gram\", and so on.","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":97052,"python_rank":16272},{"name":"Avynn/Cat-GAN","owner":"Avynn","html_url":"https://github.com/Avynn/Cat-GAN","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"a generative adverserial network created to identify and generate cats","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":97055,"python_rank":16273},{"name":"davidbmar/Palindrome-Index","owner":"davidbmar","html_url":"https://github.com/davidbmar/Palindrome-Index","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Given a string, , of lowercase letters, determine the index of the character whose removal will make  a palindrome. If  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, then print . There will always be a valid solution, and any correct answer is acceptable. For example, if  \"bcbc\", we can either remove 'b' at index  or 'c' at index .  Input Format  The first line contains an integer, , denoting the number of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":97063,"python_rank":16274},{"name":"yangchris11/MOTRv2","owner":"yangchris11","html_url":"https://github.com/yangchris11/MOTRv2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":97074,"python_rank":16275},{"name":"ipl-uw/Infant-Pose-Classification","owner":"ipl-uw","html_url":"https://github.com/ipl-uw/Infant-Pose-Classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":97075,"python_rank":16276},{"name":"adamowada/game-of-greed2","owner":"adamowada","html_url":"https://github.com/adamowada/game-of-greed2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2299,"global_rank":97085,"python_rank":16277},{"name":"kornatskyi/cryptographic-algorithms","owner":"kornatskyi","html_url":"https://github.com/kornatskyi/cryptographic-algorithms","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"My implementations of different cryptographic algorithms","topics":[],"score":2